From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristof Imeri <kristof@lanth.me>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:01:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] tests/x11: Cancel reading selections from owners that
 stop answering

Add an X11 client that owns the clipboard and either never answers a
request for its contents or stops after the first chunk of an INCR
transfer, and check that cancelling the transfer from it finishes it.
---
